SEP wake-timing probe: send a getrandom (EP 0xff cmd 16) before TZ0 in start().
If the SEP answers (RX type 0x74 via sep-trace-rx) it is awake at sep-probe time;
if silent (like TZ0) it is asleep by the time Linux can safely reach it. Applies
AFTER sep-trace-tx. Temporary diagnostic (MacFingerprint Touch ID RE).

